  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "econ_t",
   "x": 66,
   "y": 476,
   "width": 608,
   "height": 98,
   "text": "Cascade economics (vendor claim)\n\nJEV resolves the easy ~90% at ~70-500ms and $0.042/M in (output free); only the ~10%\nlow-confidence tail pays LLM latency + cost. Worst case = today's all-LLM behaviour,\nso the change is strictly additive.",
   "originalText": "Cascade economics (vendor claim)\n\nJEV resolves the easy ~90% at ~70-500ms and $0.042/M in (output free); only the ~10%\nlow-confidence tail pays LLM latency + cost. Worst case = today's all-LLM behaviour,\nso the change is strictly additive.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 4885,
